        }
      }
    },
    "Glotty is a language tutor that lives in your menu bar. We'll quickly tour the three core actions, then have you set up an LLM, then chat briefly so I know how to address you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glotty is a language tutor that lives in your menu bar. We'll quickly tour the three core actions, then have you set up an LLM, then chat briefly so I know how to address you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glotty 是常驻菜单栏的语言学习助手。我们先快速浏览三个核心功能,接着配置 LLM,最后简短聊一下,让我知道该怎么称呼你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glotty 是常駐選單列的語言學習助手。我們先快速看過三個核心功能,接著設定 LLM,最後簡短聊一下,讓我知道該怎麼稱呼你。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glotty はメニューバーに常駐する語学学習アシスタントです。まず 3 つの主要機能をざっと見て、LLM を設定し、最後にあなたの呼び方を教えてもらうために少しおしゃべりしましょう。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glotty는 메뉴 막대에 상주하는 언어 학습 도우미입니다. 먼저 세 가지 핵심 기능을 살펴보고, LLM을 설정한 다음, 어떻게 불러드리면 좋을지 짧게 대화해 보아요."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glotty es un tutor de idiomas que vive en tu barra de menús. Veremos rápido las tres acciones principales, luego configurarás un LLM y al final charlaremos un momento para saber cómo dirigirme a ti."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glotty est un tuteur linguistique installé dans votre barre de menus. Nous allons survoler les trois actions principales, puis configurer un LLM, et enfin discuter brièvement pour que je sache comment t'appeler."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glotty ist ein Sprach-Tutor in deiner Menüleiste. Wir gehen kurz die drei Hauptaktionen durch, richten dann ein LLM ein und plaudern zum Schluss kurz, damit ich weiß, wie ich dich ansprechen soll."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glotty is ready!": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glotty 准备就绪!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glotty is reviewing this chat…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glotty 正在浏览这段对话…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glotty is thinking\\u{2026}": {
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "Glotty lives in your menu bar — click the mascot for options.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glotty 常驻菜单栏 —— 点击吉祥物查看选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glotty needs these permissions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glotty 需要以下权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glotty noticed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glotty 注意到"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glotty posts a notification at the cadence you pick. Click the notification to open a chat in your target language. Same as triggering Fn → C manually.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glotty 会按你选择的频率发送通知。点击通知即可用目标语言开始对话,效果等同于手动按 Fn → C。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glotty proposes new memories after every chat reply. Highest token usage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次聊天回复后 Glotty 都会提取新记忆。token 消耗最高。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glotty proposes new memories after every chat reply. Highest token usage."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Glotty saves what you searched and which mistakes Polish flagged. Stored locally in Application Support; never sent off-device. The time range only filters the lists below — history itself is never pruned.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glotty 会保存你查询过的内容和「润色」标记的错误。仅保存在本机的 Application Support 中,不会上传。时间范围只用于过滤下方列表 —— 历史本身永不删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glotty's UI language": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glotty 的界面语言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
