          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始引导对话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Status updates live. Grant in System Settings — this window refreshes automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "状态实时更新。在「系统设置」中授权 —— 此窗口会自动刷新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stored in Keychain. Not included so the bundle stays safe to share.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存在钥匙串中。出于安全考虑,导出包不包含密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suggestions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建议"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System language": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统语言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test connection": {
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "The engine that powers Fn → R polish. API keys are stored in macOS Keychain. Polish output language and prompt templates live in the Polish tab.": {
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "The language Fn → R rewrites your selection into. Not the same as Translation's target.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fn → R 将所选文本重写为的语言。与「翻译」的目标语言不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language you speak natively. Drives auto-detected source / target choices and biases translation behavior toward what you're likely reading or writing. Separate from Glotty's UI language below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的母语。用于自动判断源语言 / 目标语言,并优化你常读写语言的翻译表现。与下方 Glotty 的界面语言相互独立。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then quit & relaunch Glotty.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "然后退出并重新启动 Glotty。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking…": {
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "This Mac doesn't support Apple Intelligence": {
