            "value": "用量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use **Export** to write a single JSON file with your Glotty settings, learned memories, chat threads, and activity history. Use **Import** on another machine (or this one, after a wipe) to restore it. Imports REPLACE local data — you'll get a confirmation prompt first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用「导出」将你的 Glotty 设置、学到的记忆、聊天对话和活动历史写入一个 JSON 文件。在另一台设备(或本机重置后)使用「导入」来恢复。导入会**替换**本地数据 —— 操作前会先弹出确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
